      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about the toxicity thing but i've read online that people take way more than that for constipation or whatever. i'm not worried about \"toxicity\" if it stops these cramps. also i have some kidney issues that my doctor mentioned a while ago, but it's nothing serious so i don't think it matters for a supplement. if i take the 1000mg, will it actually help the cramps if the dose is higher? just tell me if it's safe enough for a few days.",
